r.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-165023729"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 24, 2011 at 1:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-126289448024129024</id><published>2010-06-28T20:02:17.685-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-28T20:02:17.685-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;If you want good government you have to elec...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;If you want good government you have to elect good people.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Unless the system turns into a monster which breaks good people and cancels out or manipulates their good intentions?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Then it doesn&amp;#39;t matter how many &amp;quot;good people&amp;quot; get elected or what the voters do.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Besides, from what many people say, the primary process locks out grass roots candidates, the two party process rules.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Two wolves and a sheep voting on what&amp;#39;s for dinner.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/126289448024129024'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/126289448024129024'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277776937685#c126289448024129024' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1887738706"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 28, 2010 at 8:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3545770578920921976</id><published>2010-06-28T19:49:58.010-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-28T19:49:58.010-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Re: the garbage government that we have is the vot...</title><content type='html'>Re: the garbage government that we have is the voters&amp;#39; fault.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This tediously repeated concept - is now - and has always been - a crock of crap.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And what the heck happened to the blog format?????? What&amp;#39;s with the new look???</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/3545770578920921976'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/3545770578920921976'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277776198010#c3545770578920921976' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1863558526"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 28, 2010 at 7:49 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1981344870401289717</id><published>2010-06-28T15:27:15.755-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-28T15:27:15.755-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The outrage in the article and the comments focus ...</title><content type='html'>The outrage in the article and the comments focus on the police (ok psycho criminals).  But where is the outrage for the people who are actually to blame.  I&amp;#39;m not talking about the morons in the city government who hired the scum in blue, I am talking about the s*** for brains a******s who elected the morons who hired the scum in blue.  At some point the blame has to be put on the voters.  If you want good government you have to elect good people.  And sometimes that means you have to run for office.  If the voters won&amp;#39;t elect good people then the garbage government that we have is the voters&amp;#39; fault.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/1981344870401289717'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/1981344870401289717'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277760435755#c1981344870401289717' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-956460489"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 28, 2010 at 3:27 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2813351773073406440</id><published>2010-06-28T10:06:59.049-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-28T10:06:59.049-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The people over at ALIPAC are of course putting th...</title><content type='html'>The people over at ALIPAC are of course putting the blame on the firing of the police force on the illegal immigrants in the city.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Anything to advance the agenda...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/2813351773073406440'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/2813351773073406440'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277741219049#c2813351773073406440' title=''/><author><name>Dave P.</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-345905281"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 28, 2010 at 10:06 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4206268158525290810</id><published>2010-06-28T00:22:04.228-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-28T00:22:04.228-06:00</updated><title type='text'>thanks for this show of the police there duty is t...</title><content type='html'>thanks for this show of the police there duty is to save the public</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/4206268158525290810'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/4206268158525290810'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277706124228#c4206268158525290810' title=''/><author><name>download tv show</name><uri>http://www.edogo.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2133300411"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 28, 2010 at 12:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4422358304644662964</id><published>2010-06-27T22:23:08.239-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-27T22:23:08.239-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks for this &amp;quot;wonderful&amp;quot; article, Wil...</title><content type='html'>Thanks for this &amp;quot;wonderful&amp;quot; article, Will. I&amp;#39;ve always wondered why people consider the police their friend.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Around 1980, the Coshocton, Ohio PD was disbanded because the city could no longer sustain the lawsuits. It&amp;#39;s been a long time, and I&amp;#39;m going by memory, but two cases that seem to have broke the back of the proverbial camel were (1) the police beating of a man on his way home from receiving an award from a civic organization and (2) a cop beating up his wife in the police locker room while several other cops watched and cheered him on. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The city ditched the PD.  The Sheriff hired the good cops.  As far as I know the PD has not been reconstituted.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/4422358304644662964'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/4422358304644662964'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277698988239#c4422358304644662964' title=''/><author><name>BD</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15184124024369071862</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://photos1.blogger.com/blogger/808/899/320/resize-IMG_0251.2.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-808682815"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 27, 2010 at 10:23 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2299224749591934159</id><published>2010-06-27T00:17:56.131-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-27T00:17:56.131-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Government is a racket, of Spartans over Helots......</title><content type='html'>Government is a racket, of Spartans over Helots... Which am I? Which are you? How does one tell? &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This whole American caste system is confusing at times.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;ve seen stubborn cows in a barn refusing to get up and leave being persuaded by a swift boot kick and a strong tug on a halter, the cow was the farmers property though.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It seems pretty clear, people are property, only it&amp;#39;s not put that way.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;Once the kid was handcuffed, he was repeatedly attacked with a Taser.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Barbaric, but of course that is the new normal.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;p.s.&lt;br /&gt;What&amp;#39;s the reference above to Fort Collins mean?  I&amp;#39;m guessing, a cop on every block?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/2299224749591934159'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/2299224749591934159'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277619476131#c2299224749591934159' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-328264018"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 27, 2010 at 12:17 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7382444359489736658</id><published>2010-06-25T22:21:26.958-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-25T22:21:26.958-06:00</updated><title type='text'>What dixiedog said!  What a joy to see a link to y...</title><content type='html'>What dixiedog said!  What a joy to see a link to your work at Lew Rockwell&amp;#39;s site at the top of Drudge&amp;#39;s main column.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I just wish that the subject matter weren&amp;#39;t so troublesome, and that&amp;#39;s putting it mildly.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/7382444359489736658'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/7382444359489736658'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277526086958#c7382444359489736658' title=''/><author><name>Uncle Al</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1740071825"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 25, 2010 at 10:21 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6359477086483688028</id><published>2010-06-25T18:25:39.954-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-25T18:25:39.954-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Fantastic write up of this heinous activity Will, ...</title><content type='html'>Fantastic write up of this heinous activity Will, as usual.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;One image link seems to be dead though.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/6359477086483688028'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/6359477086483688028'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277511939954#c6359477086483688028' title=''/><author><name>QB</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1847614750"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 25, 2010 at 6:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3790826584152755922</id><published>2010-06-25T16:42:33.149-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-25T16:42:33.149-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Excellent article.&#xa;&#xa;I hear that the city council i...</title><content type='html'>Excellent article.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I hear that the city council is getting a lot of heat over their disbanding their government.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I live in a small town in New Hampshire, next to other small towns, and we prefer having as little government as possible. Next door in Grafton theres one full time cop, the police chief, and a couple part timers. They eliminated building permits and instead require &amp;quot;building notices&amp;quot; i.e. property owners dont have to get permission to build, but they do have to notify the town they are building.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;m looking forward to seeing what becomes of Maywood. Will it become the Somalia of California, or the Fort Collins?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/3790826584152755922'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/3790826584152755922'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277505753149#c3790826584152755922' title=''/><author><name>Mike Lorrey</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03094443839137951482</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-85176101"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 25, 2010 at 4:42 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9009399176804341417</id><published>2010-06-25T16:00:12.948-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-25T16:00:12.948-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Damn, Will, your stuff is appearing on Drudge thes...</title><content type='html'>Damn, Will, your stuff is appearing on Drudge these days 8).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I should have suspected right away that that &amp;quot;Police taser 86-year-old bedridden granny...&amp;quot; story would link back to you...hehe!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Keep on rainin&amp;#39; on the paladin brigade in state-issued costumes, Will. Eventually, you &lt;i&gt;do&lt;/i&gt; get noticed by &amp;quot;big boys&amp;quot; with a lot of visibility.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/9009399176804341417'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/9009399176804341417'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html?showComment=1277503212948#c9009399176804341417' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='30' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_Zqy-qAblsH8/S9eDlUyYkSI/AAAAAAAAACE/cWWKCwCbjWk/S220/001.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/maywood-rip-when-police-kill-city.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6230262548960212955' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6230262548960212955' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 25, 2010 at 4:00 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7626447068018860181</id><published>2010-06-25T07:33:42.569-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-25T07:33:42.569-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks so much for the article. I sent it on to ou...</title><content type='html'>Thanks so much for the article. I sent it on to our County Sheriff. He is one of the good guys.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Bob&lt;br /&gt;III</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6230262548960212955/comments/default/7626447068018860181'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+